<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Clustering vs Classification: Confusing unsupervised grouping (Clustering) with supervised labelling (Classification).</li>
        <li>Correlation as Causality: In association rule mining, assuming that because items A and B are bought together, A causes the purchase of B.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

